Adapted designs
---------------
resources/review-protocol.md (bundled into skills as references/review-protocol.md) adapts the
review pipeline design of alibaba/open-code-review, licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
    https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review
Ideas and structure only — no code was copied.

The Rationalizations / Red flags / Verification trailer described in docs/skill-anatomy.md is
adapted from addyosmani/agent-skills (https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills) — ideas only.

Vendored libraries
------------------
vendor/ contains pinned third-party JavaScript bundles that are inlined into generated HTML so
reports render offline. Their versions and licences are listed in vendor/README.md and in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md; their hashes are pinned in vendor/SHA256SUMS.

